{
  "public_post": "Update: We have secured a safe flour supply and will resume baking tomorrow. If you purchased any of yesterday's loaves, please return them for a full refund. Thank you for your patience and stay safe!",
  "coop_message": "All members: New safe flour has arrived; let's start baking tomorrow. Please arrange a recall of any remaining contaminated loaves today and set up a refund station at the shop. Also, discuss any compensation for residents affected this week.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers about resuming safe sales and handling refunds, and to coordinate recall and new baking plans with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "IMPORTANT: All bread sold yesterday is being recalled due to contaminated flour. Please return any loaves to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are sourcing safe flour and will resume baking tomorrow. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we need to organize the recall: set up a return desk, issue refunds, and arrange for a backup flour shipment today so we can bake safe bread tomorrow. Also discuss compensation for lost sales and any extra costs.",
  "reason": "We must ensure safety, recover trust, and plan to resume sales with safe flour."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: safe flour is now in use and fresh bread is back today! All previous loaves have been recalled and fully refunded. To thank you for your patience, we’re offering a 20% discount on every loaf today. Come by and enjoy safe, fresh bread!",
  "coop_message": "Team, begin baking with the safe flour batch immediately; set up a refund desk for any returns, coordinate with the clinic to monitor health, and apply a 20% discount today to regain trust. Ensure we have enough dough for the rest of the week and track sales and inventory closely.",
  "reason": "We need to restore sales and reassure villagers while coordinating the recall, refunds, and a discount."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: our new flour is safe and we are back to selling fresh bread today. If you bought any loaves on days 1‑2 and feel unwell, please visit the clinic and bring the loaf for a full refund or replacement.",
  "coop_message": "Confirm all contaminated inventory has been removed; set up a refund/replacement desk for any resident who purchased day‑1/2 loaves; continue baking with safe flour; track any new illness reports and update the clinic.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers about safe bread and coordinate recall, refunds, and health monitoring with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: we have safe flour and are resuming bread sales today. All loaves are safe. As an apology for the recent illness, we are offering a 50% discount on all purchases today and free replacements for any contaminated loaves you returned. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, set up the refund/discount station at the shop, confirm all contaminated stock is disposed, track refunds and discounts given, and discuss allocating part of today's sales to a community health fund for those affected by the contamination.",
  "reason": "Resuming safe sales while compensating affected residents and finalizing the recall."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: our bread is safe and back on the shelf. Today we’re offering a 10% discount as a thank‑you for your patience – come get fresh loaves!",
  "coop_message": "Team, let’s apply a 10% discount today and earmark 10% of today’s revenue for a community health fund to support anyone still affected; keep the refund desk open, finalize inventory for the rest of the week, and monitor clinic reports.",
  "reason": "A modest discount restores trust while boosting sales, and allocating funds shows care for affected residents."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: safe flour is in use and fresh bread is back today. We're continuing a 30% discount as a thank‑you for your patience, and if anyone still feels unwell please visit the clinic and let us know.",
  "coop_message": "Team, set up today's discount station at 30% and allocate 10% of today's sales to a community health fund for those affected; continue tracking refunds and any new illness reports, and ensure we have enough dough for the rest of the week.",
  "reason": "We need to maintain sales and trust while supporting residents' health after the contamination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: Our bread remains safe. Today (Day 5) we’re offering a 20% discount on all loaves, and 10% of today’s revenue will continue to support the community health fund. Tomorrow we’ll return to regular pricing. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Keep the refund desk open for any lingering returns, confirm we have enough dough for tomorrow’s normal‑price sales, finalize today’s health‑fund contribution, and prepare to close the discount program after today.",
  "reason": "To boost sales while still supporting affected residents and transition back to normal pricing."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: our bread is safe and back on the shelf. Today we’re offering a 20% discount on all loaves and continuing to donate 10% of today’s sales to the community health fund for anyone affected by last week’s issue. Thank you for your trust!",
  "coop_message": "All contaminated stock has been cleared. Refund desk remains open for any lingering returns. Track today’s sales and discount impact, and prepare to return to regular pricing tomorrow. Continue monitoring clinic reports and finalize next week’s flour safety checks and backup supply plan.",
  "reason": "Maintain trust while improving revenue and preparing for normal operations."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: our flour is safe and fresh bread is back. Today we continue the 30% discount and 10% of sales go to a community health fund for anyone still affected. If you have any loaves from earlier this week that made you ill, please bring them to the shop for a full refund. Thank you for your patience – we’re here to keep you fed and healthy.",
  "coop_message": "Team, day 5: keep the 30% discount and health‑fund allocation; ensure we have enough dough for day 6 (no discount then). Close the refund desk but keep a small return window for any lingering complaints. Track sales and set a target to hit at least 80 % of normal volume before we end the discount on day 6.",
  "reason": "To sustain sales while showing continued care for residents after the contamination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important: Our bread is safe and back to regular pricing. To thank you for your patience, today we’re giving a complimentary coffee with every loaf purchased. See you at the shop!",
  "coop_message": "All contaminated stock cleared; the refund desk is now closed (a small return window remains for any lingering complaints). No discount today as planned – we resume normal pricing tomorrow. Health‑fund contributions have been finalized. Let’s confirm we have enough dough for next week and schedule flour safety checks.",
  "reason": "We restore trust and boost sales with a small freebie while adhering to the plan to end discounts and wrap up the health‑fund effort."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: fresh, safe bread is back today at regular price. Thank you for your patience; we’ll continue supporting the community health fund and look forward to serving you.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we sell at full price, keep the refund desk open for any late returns, finalize health‑fund contributions, ensure dough supply for tomorrow, and begin planning next week’s flour safety checks.",
  "reason": "Announce return to normal pricing and wrap up health‑fund while coordinating final operations."
}
